---
layout: base.njk
title: People | Bamford Lab
description: The people of the Bamford Lab at Queen's University Belfast, and the research that drives them.
permalink: /people/index.html
---

    <!-- WHO WE ARE -->
    <section class="section" style="padding-top:8rem;" id="about">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="section-head reveal" style="max-width:760px;">
                <h2>Decoding the molecular mechanisms of viruses and immunity</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="reveal" style="max-width:760px; color:var(--text-dim);">
                <p style="margin-bottom:1rem;">We are a mixed, multidisciplinary team spanning virology, evolution, drug design and computation. We value good science, good mentoring and a supportive culture, and we care as much about training the next generation of scientists as we do about the discoveries themselves.</p>
                <p>Led by Dr Connor Bamford, the lab brings over a decade of experience with disease-causing viruses of humans and animals, including work that was central to Northern Ireland's response to the COVID-19 pandemic.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="lab-banner reveal">
                <img src="/assets/lab/group-qub.jpg" alt="The Bamford Lab at Queen's University Belfast">
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- PEOPLE -->
    <section class="section section-alt" id="people">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="section-head reveal">
                <h2>Meet the lab</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="people">
                {% for person in collections.people %}
                <div class="person" onclick="this.classList.toggle('open')">
                    <div class="photo">{% if person.data.photo %}<img src="{{ person.data.photo }}" alt="{{ person.data.name }}">{% else %}{{ person.data.initials }}{% endif %}</div>
                    <div class="info">
                        <div class="name">{{ person.data.name }}</div>
                        <div class="role">{{ person.data.role }}</div>
                        <div class="bio">{{ person.templateContent | safe }}</div>
                        {% if person.data.projectTitle %}
                        <p class="project"><b>{{ person.data.projectLabel or "Project" }}:</b> {{ person.data.projectTitle }}
                            {% if person.data.funders %}<span class="funders">{{ person.data.funders }}</span>{% endif %}
                        </p>
                        {% endif %}
                        {% if person.data.outside %}<p class="fun"><b>Outside the lab:</b> {{ person.data.outside }}</p>{% endif %}
                        <a href="/people/{{ person.data.name | slugify }}/" class="profile-link" onclick="event.stopPropagation()">Full profile &rarr;</a>
                        <div class="expand">Read more</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                {% endfor %}
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- LIFE IN THE LAB -->
    <section class="section" id="lab-life">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="section-head reveal">
                <h2>Life in the lab</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="gallery">
                <img src="/assets/lab/lab-dinner-1.jpg" alt="Bamford Lab dinner" class="reveal">
                <img src="/assets/lab/lab-outreach.jpg" alt="Bamford Lab science outreach" class="reveal">
                <img src="/assets/lab/lab-graduation.jpg" alt="Bamford Lab graduation" class="reveal">
                <img src="/assets/lab/lab-group-spring.jpg" alt="Bamford Lab group" class="reveal">
                <img src="/assets/lab/lab-dinner-2.jpg" alt="Bamford Lab dinner" class="reveal">
            </div>

            {# Poster bodies in these photos are deliberately blurred (only titles and authors
               left sharp) so unpublished results are not readable on the public site. Do the
               same for any future poster photo. #}
            <div class="section-head reveal" style="margin-top:3.5rem; margin-bottom:1.5rem;">
                <h3 style="font-size:1.5rem; color:var(--heading); font-weight:600;">At the Microbiology Society Annual Meeting in Ireland 2026</h3>
            </div>
            <div class="talks talks-4">
                <figure class="reveal"><img src="/assets/lab/talk-james-irish.jpg" alt="James McCabe giving a talk"><figcaption><b>James McCabe</b> (talk): evolutionary biology and deep learning to find selective druggable targets in immune signalling</figcaption></figure>
                <figure class="reveal"><img src="/assets/lab/poster-mollie-irish.jpg" alt="Mollie Nisbet with her poster"><figcaption><b>Mollie Nisbet</b>: RNA viruses and endogenous viral elements in ascaridid nematodes</figcaption></figure>
                <figure class="reveal"><img src="/assets/lab/poster-jiaying-irish.jpg" alt="Jiaying Gu with her poster"><figcaption><b>Jiaying Gu</b>: chemical pollution and pathogen ecology, in the wild and in the lab</figcaption></figure>
                <figure class="reveal"><img src="/assets/lab/poster-banbha-irish.jpg" alt="Banbha O'Neill with her poster"><figcaption><b>Banbha O'Neill</b>: tick-borne flaviviruses in vertebrates in Northern Ireland</figcaption></figure>
            </div>

            <div class="section-head reveal" style="margin-top:3.5rem; margin-bottom:1.5rem;">
                <h3 style="font-size:1.5rem; color:var(--heading); font-weight:600;">At the Microbiology Society Annual Conference 2026, Belfast</h3>
            </div>
            <div class="talks">
                <figure class="reveal"><img src="/assets/lab/talk-jiaying.jpg" alt="Jiaying Gu presenting"><figcaption><b>Jiaying Gu</b>: lead pollution and viral resilience in wild otters</figcaption></figure>
                <figure class="reveal"><img src="/assets/lab/talk-katie.jpg" alt="Kaitlin Donovan presenting"><figcaption><b>Kaitlin Donovan</b>: antiviral patterns induced by human interferon lambdas</figcaption></figure>
                <figure class="reveal"><img src="/assets/lab/talk-aaron.jpg" alt="Aaron Canton Bastarrachea presenting"><figcaption><b>Aaron Canton Bastarrachea</b>: influenza A viruses in environmental samples</figcaption></figure>
                <figure class="reveal"><img src="/assets/lab/talk-james.jpg" alt="James McCabe presenting"><figcaption><b>James McCabe</b>: deep learning and evolution for immune signalling</figcaption></figure>
                <figure class="reveal"><img src="/assets/lab/talk-mollie.jpg" alt="Mollie Nisbet presenting a poster"><figcaption><b>Mollie Nisbet</b>: viral interactions with gastrointestinal nematodes</figcaption></figure>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

